   8:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
   9:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           + Peripheral Control functions
